comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T21:23:58.470Z",codex-agent,"Regression reproduces issue #4 using a real SDK tracker and deterministic LM only. Repeated spawn of a terminal model/budget-refused digest makes one child inference, closes the child with RLM refusal evidence, and both replay and resume return the root answer without new inference. Also cover a context refusal before child inference and replay tampering of the typed refusal code."
  "2026-10-18T21:30:49.384Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: node test/revert.ts passed 6/6 mutations with exact source hash restoration. Removing only the child terminal-failure assignment makes the issue #4 regression fail with ERR_ASSERTION (exit 1). Typed model refusal, repeated digest reuse, real child context refusal, closure evidence, replay and resume are covered in test/review.test.ts. Legacy completed checkpoints with unfinished children now fail closed as incomplete instead of reporting recovery."
  "2026-10-18T21:34:37.080Z",codex-agent,"pm test pm-rlm-k7tv --run --progress passed 1/1 linked commands and 3/3 selected real-SDK regressions, with zero assertion/trust/configuration/timeout failures. Tests cover model and budget child refusals plus actual child context refusal before inference."
  "2026-10-18T21:59:33.109Z",codex-agent,"Review fix verified: isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed all 12 gates, 85/85 suite tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus Bun/bunx acceptance. Coverage is 1514/1514 statements and lines, 634/634 branches, 77/77 functions across 19 authored files. Issue #4 regressions and all six behavioral revert proofs pass. No development items were closed."
  "2026-10-21T19:26:28.538Z",codex-agent,"Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Owner-authorized takeover of any historical assignment for this verified terminal transition. Reverified current main ef32c4cad9ad: merged #2 (90b99a0); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Record terminal typed failures for child calls.** [PR #2](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/2) (90b99a0), refined in #8, delivers typed complete environment reads, durable call ledger/budgets, crash resume, versioned replay, bounded adapters and terminal child-refusal evidence; corresponding real-SDK and behavioral-revert fixtures are committed."
